5.Execute the command in DUT. During the execution, the DUT will playback av for NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT seconds and waits for few seconds after NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VIDEO_END_POINT upon which buffer underflow signal must be received.
6.Verify the output from the execute command and check if the strings "Failures: 0" and "Errors: 0", or "failed: 0" exists in the returned output
