5.Execute the command in DUT. During the execution, the DUT will playback av for NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT seconds and waits for few seconds after NATIVE_PLAYBACK_VIDEO_END_POINT upon which buffer underflow signal must be received. Pipeline is PAUSED after underrun and then seeked to the videoStart point and verified whetehr playback is as expected.
